	// no_user_prompt is true when the whole conversation has ZERO human-written prompts — only
	// skill invocations/args (Y empty). The session is still scored and shown on its own detail.
	// The flag marks such a session so a score-aggregate reader can exclude it — a skill-only
	// session should neither drag nor inflate the org session score (exclusion applied
